# While zoomed into a project, Up from its first child edits the title row, and Enter there adds a first child.
file <<END
Work:
	- Agenda
	- Budget
Home:
END
see Agenda
keys . <Enter> <Up> <End> <BS>
type  stuff:
keys <Enter>
type Kickoff
keys <Esc>
see Work stuff
quit
saved <<END
Work stuff:
	- Kickoff
	- Agenda
	- Budget
Home:
END
